  "recordType": "rule-chapter",
  "ruleText": "CHAPTER Env-Sw 2000 INSPECTIONS\n\nStatutory Authority: RSA 149-M:7\n\nRevision Note:\n\nDocument #8459, effective 10-28-05, readopted with amendments, renumbered, and redesignated former Chapter Env-Wm 3700 as Env-Sw 2000, pursuant to a rules reorganization plan for Department rules approved by the Director of the Office of Legislative Services on 9-7-05. The Source notes for each section of Env-Sw 2000 identify the former subtitle Env-Wm and number for the respective rule prior to Document #8459.",
